{"id":"eab12566d8ac44ad","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-halting-set.md","title":"Halting Set K","display":"df-halting-set — Halting Set K","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-halting-set","aliases":["68-df-halting-set"],"display":"df-halting-set — Halting Set K","depends_on":["[[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]","[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§14 diagonal set D, p.49 / PDF 58","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"not-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-halting-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-halting-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-halting-set — Halting Set K"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bca7d0eca4017dc7\" href=\"?note=bca7d0eca4017dc7\" title=\"68-df-kleene-normal-form\">68-df-kleene-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§14 diagonal set D, p.49 / PDF 58"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bca7d0eca4017dc7\" href=\"?note=bca7d0eca4017dc7\" title=\"68-df-kleene-normal-form\">68-df-kleene-normal-form</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 为下式引入的集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"K:=\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:\\varphi_e(e)\\downarrow\\}=\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:e\\in W_e\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[K:=\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:\\varphi_e(e)\\downarrow\\}=\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:e\\in W_e\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §14 印刷 p.49 / PDF p.58 将同一对角 RE 集记作 D；本目录继续使用 K。K 的非递归性有独立定理 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c3a69f59b70a4436\" href=\"?note=c3a69f59b70a4436\" title=\"68-thm-halting-set-undecidable\">68-thm-halting-set-undecidable</a>，不再只把它放在定义 Remark 中当作未经论证的结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-kleene-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"bca7d0eca4017dc7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-kleene-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"bca7d0eca4017dc7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$e\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\varphi_e$ 与 $W_e$ 分别见 [[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]、[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]。$K$ 为下式引入的集合。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$e\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\varphi_e$ 与 $W_e$ 分别见 [[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]、[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]。$K$ 为下式引入的集合。","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-halting-set-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"c3a69f59b70a4436","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 §14 印刷 p.49 / PDF p.58 将同一对角 RE 集记作 D；本目录继续使用 K。K 的非递归性有独立定理 [[68-thm-halting-set-undecidable]]，不再只把它放在定义 Remark 中当作未经论证的结论。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"e\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"K:=\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:\\varphi_e(e)\\downarrow\\}=\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:e\\in W_e\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1023,"backlinks":[{"id":"223508772f8e35c5","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RE}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]，$\\mathrm{Recursive}$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-set]]，$K$ 见 [[68-df-halting-set]]，$\\le_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-reducibility]]。$\\mathrm{PostProblem}$ 为以下零元命题缩写。"},{"id":"c3a69f59b70a4436","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$K$ 见 [[68-df-halting-set]]，$\\mathrm{RE}$、$\\mathrm{Recursive}$ 与 $W_e$ 见所列上游。$\\bar K:=\\mathbb N\\setminus K$。"},{"id":"87e145f3544aae62","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。$\\le_T,<_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-reducibility]]，$\\equiv_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-equivalence]]；跳跃见 [[68-df-turing-jump]]；$\\mathrm{RE}^A$ 见 [[68-df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set]]；$K$ 见 [[68-df-halting-set]]。"},{"id":"4d392f39bfd06262","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b933761613d185b9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"72b4a1b9eac21c78","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PostProblem}$ 见 [[68-df-post-problem]]，$\\mathrm{Int}$ 见 [[68-df-intermediate-degree]]；$\\mathrm{RE},\\mathrm{Recursive},K,\\le_T$ 分别见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]、[[68-df-recursive-set]]、[[68-df-halting-set]]、[[68-df-turing-reducibility]]。使用 [[68-thm-friedberg-muchnik-theorem]] 与 [[68-thm-jump-theorem]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-halting-set]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-halting-set]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-79","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-halting-set|df-halting-set — Halting Set K]]"}],"outgoing":["bca7d0eca4017dc7","913d52943499d039","c3a69f59b70a4436"]}